{c: Verse 1}
[C#m] Saari raat jaga, jaga [A] re,        [C#m] Jhume mann mera jo hara [E] re [A] eye
[C#m] Manme hein wo lamhe, saare [A] re,        [C#m] Aaj hein dhoondte, [E] yara [A] re
[C#m] Meri jan tu najana, main najana,        [A] Meri jan teri haan, meri haan
[C#m] Dar aaya dar aaya,        [E] Dar aaya [A] dar aaya [B] na
[C#m] Aaya na,        [C#m] Raat jaagi aahein mere dil mein
[A] koi aa na paya jo bhi dil ne,        [C#m] Tere liye hara eh yara re
[E] Tere liye [B] saare gham hai [A] sahe,        [E] Jab teri [B] aankhein so [A] jaein
[E] Aur teri [B] yaadein kho [A] jaein,        [G#m] Terey tan mein, [A] tere man mein
